cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software or its findings, please cite it using the metadata below."
title: "Hindsight Memory Poisoning"
abstract: >-
  Adversarial security evaluation of Hindsight's long-term memory system
  (retain / recall / reflect), quantifying the prompt-injection and
  memory-poisoning attack surface across multiple LLMs: a local
  llama3.2:3b, DeepSeek (v4-flash and v4-pro), and an OpenRouter reasoning
  model (nemotron-omni-30b). Every technique runs against a real, local
  Hindsight instance — nothing is mocked or simulated.
version: 1.0.0
